# 012-lighthouse-ttfb — Lighthouse のサーバ応答時間は 103 で何を返すか
base=http://localhost:8086 think_ms=200 cache_control=no-store samples=3

## 103 を送らない（対照）
   http://localhost:8086/012/eh?hints=none&ms=200&cc=no-store
   #1 server-response-time=212ms first-contentful-paint=1055ms largest-contentful-paint=1205ms
   #2 server-response-time=206ms first-contentful-paint=1064ms largest-contentful-paint=1214ms
   #3 server-response-time=207ms first-contentful-paint=1074ms largest-contentful-paint=1224ms

## 103 で実際に使う資源を先読みさせる
   http://localhost:8086/012/eh?hints=preload&ms=200&cc=no-store
   #1 server-response-time=1ms first-contentful-paint=1058ms largest-contentful-paint=1208ms
   #2 server-response-time=1ms first-contentful-paint=1069ms largest-contentful-paint=1219ms
   #3 server-response-time=2ms first-contentful-paint=1071ms largest-contentful-paint=1221ms

server-response-time: 207ms（103 なし）→ 1ms（103 あり）
server-response-time は 103 で落ちるか: YES
largest-contentful-paint: 1214ms → 1219ms
画面の指標も動いたか: no
103 でレポートが壊れるか: no
